    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "\u3000    <strong><i>\u201dGood morning... Nice to meet you, I guess.&quot;</i></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973120/extras/1b41106cb947a14d8af7840befc607c1.avif?t=1748851565\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><br><strong>This is a metroidvania where you interact with characters in an apocalyptic world and fight mechanical creatures that remain in mysterious ruins.</strong><br><br>The bustling era has passed, and Earth has entered the twilight. People are now leading modest yet peaceful lives on the remaining lands.<br><br>On a certain island, a being called Witch used her magical powers to help the people in the town.<br><br>And you will discover the world's mysteries as you land on the island and explore it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973120/extras/b978873789bdb5f3a8ca4fa657728d57.poster.avif?t=1748851565\" width=610 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973120/extras/b978873789bdb5f3a8ca4fa657728d57.webm?t=1748851565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973120/extras/b978873789bdb5f3a8ca4fa657728d57.mp4?t=1748851565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>\u25a0Feature\u25a0</strong><br><br><strong>\u30fbApocalyptic world depicted by various techniques</strong><br>The neon-lit cityscape, the deserted coastline\u2014these transparent and beautiful maps are expressed in pixel art.<br>While the characters are depicted in delicate pixel style on the map and in illustrations during conversation.<br>Of course, the enemies are all rendered in pixel art too. Let's explore this pixelated world of metroidvania.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973120/extras/e9c831fc593012faaac99a2e55494dba.poster.avif?t=1748851565\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973120/extras/e9c831fc593012faaac99a2e55494dba.webm?t=1748851565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973120/extras/e9c831fc593012faaac99a2e55494dba.mp4?t=1748851565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\u30fbCharming girls living in the island</strong><br>You are going to meet numerous charming female characters, such as Witch, a mysterious woman who help you <br>in various ways despite lacking emotional expression. There's also Mayor, who manage the island with compassion and<br>kindness, and Mogura, who runs a junk shop with her sister and has an eye for treasures that could be used as crafting materials.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973120/extras/48a37972033ba35e5a078a8632035004.avif?t=1748851565\" width=610 height=343 /></span><br><br><strong>\u30fbExplore ruins with lantern</strong><br>In the ruins, junk creatures are still operational, making it dangerous to enter unprotected. <br>Use the lantern received from Witch to protect yourself from dangers and obtain various treasure that<br>lie deep within the ruins.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973120/extras/df68b69b5f6a44983e2b8f027392a8ad.poster.avif?t=1748851565\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973120/extras/df68b69b5f6a44983e2b8f027392a8ad.webm?t=1748851565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973120/extras/df68b69b5f6a44983e2b8f027392a8ad.mp4?t=1748851565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\u30fbCustomize your lantern</strong><br>Lantern can be customized using parts found within the town or in the ruins.<br>Combine various parts with different stats freely to upgrade lantern to your preferences.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973120/extras/311d558bced83be4fdced1bc80172895.avif?t=1748851565\" width=610 height=343 /></span><br><br><strong>\u30fbArtifacts that are key to exploration</strong><br> By handing over materials found in ruins to Witch, she will create artifacts that will aid you in your exploration.<br>Use these artifacts to expand your search and venture deeper into the ruins.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973120/extras/00d70e9d8b8788fb893fa34a06414c5b.poster.avif?t=1748851565\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973120/extras/00d70e9d8b8788fb893fa34a06414c5b.webm?t=1748851565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973120/extras/00d70e9d8b8788fb893fa34a06414c5b.mp4?t=1748851565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\u30fbUtilizing special weapons in battle</strong><br>At the town's junk shop, you can create and upgrade special weapons using materials found in the ruins. <br>Utilize different special weapons to gain upper hand against formidable enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973120/extras/36406a23a70b42c92f0fb0bdaa3a9016.poster.avif?t=1748851565\" width=614 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973120/extras/36406a23a70b42c92f0fb0bdaa3a9016.webm?t=1748851565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973120/extras/36406a23a70b42c92f0fb0bdaa3a9016.mp4?t=1748851565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\u30fbVarious subquests</strong><br>From time to time, townspeople may ask you to help them find something. If you deliver an item you found in the ruins, <br>you might receive a reward in return.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973120/extras/7149db5160f855dbda981e5192c6de70.poster.avif?t=1748851565\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973120/extras/7149db5160f855dbda981e5192c6de70.webm?t=1748851565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973120/extras/7149db5160f855dbda981e5192c6de70.mp4?t=1748851565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
